# Build context for deploy/engine/Containerfile (context = repo root).
# Allowlist: the image COPYs only pyproject.toml, README.md, kalos/ and the
# lock-derived deploy/engine/constraints.txt, so nothing else is sent to the
# builder. New top-level files (a local .env,
# deploy/backups/, .venv, .git, agent worktrees) are excluded by default.
# Podman reads this file; .dockerignore is a symlink to it for Docker.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!kalos/
!deploy/engine/constraints.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
